Datasets and model weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does NOT bundle any pre-trained model weights.
All models referenced by this project are trained from scratch on EuroSAT.

Dataset: EuroSAT (RGB distribution)
  Source:  Zenodo record 7711810 <https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7711810>
  License: MIT
  Note:    The dataset itself is NOT redistributed in this repository.
           It is downloaded at setup time and verified by SHA-256 checksum.

  Citation:
    P. Helber, B. Bischke, A. Dengel, D. Borth,
    "EuroSAT: A Novel Dataset and Deep Learning Benchmark for Land Use and
    Land Cover Classification," IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied
    Earth Observations and Remote Sensing, 2019.
